## This repository

<!-- Repository-owned: written once at Initialize, then maintained by ordinary PRs. -->

- `tally` is a TypeScript command-line time tracker with optional sync to a hosted API.
- Carried from `CONTRIBUTING.md`: tests never call the real sync API; they use the mock in
  `test/fixtures/sync-server.ts`.
- Carried from `CONTRIBUTING.md`: user-visible CLI changes add a line to `CHANGELOG.md`
  under "Unreleased".
